# One conversation with the core, replayed with no core, no sockets and no
# media files: an empty playlist starts, answers health and state, takes a
# list through configure, refuses a tool it does not have and an item it does
# not hold, stops and shuts down. `core` lines go to the plugin's stdin;
# `plugin` lines must appear on its stderr in this order, as a subset of the
# real line. "*" matches any value.
#
# Replay it with `cargo test --test offline`, or `gmx plugin test --offline`.
